sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Signup form
    participant API as authentication
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Note over FE,API: no account yet. Web sends a token, mobile does not, neither is read
    FE->>API: POST /verify-referral-code
    API->>DB: profile, then affiliate
    API-->>FE: 200 referralObj, or 400 not found
    FE->>API: POST /register { referral_code }
    API->>DB: same lookup again, then Profile.create
